  rcases used with e|e|e|e|h|h
  · rcases hr with rfl|rfl|rfl <;> simp [L,Q6EndpointCell.ports,base] at e
  · rcases hr with rfl|rfl|rfl <;> simp [L,Q6EndpointCell.ports,base] at e
  · rcases hr with rfl|rfl|rfl <;> simp [L,Q6EndpointCell.ports,base] at e
  · rcases hr with rfl|rfl|rfl <;> simp [L,Q6EndpointCell.ports,base] at e
